blocks.en:
Figure 6: Reasoning detection beyond surface cues. (A) Native reasoning recall on original texts with unrelated Pile controls;
(B) recall with reasoning structure preserved but surface cues removed;
(C) false feature activation with cues retained but reasoning structure removed. Mean-Chunk retains strong native recall, detects cue-free
reasoning, and rejects cue-only distractors.

blocks.zh:
图6:超出表面提示的合理探测。 (A) 对原文进行原生推理回顾,不附带Pile控制;
(B) 保留推理结构,但消除表面提示;
(C) 假特性激活,保留提示,但删除推理结构。 Mean-Chunk 保留强烈的原生召回, 检测到无提示
推理,并拒绝只带线索的转移器。
